used to specify some of the launch settings, and the environment variables used
by the application. Therefore, it is possible to run the application using the
dotnet run command by specifying a profile using the --launch-profile
flag;
appsettings.json and appsettings.{Environment}.json contains the
settings based on our environment. They are replacements for the settings section
in the web.config file.
